   "modelled": "Backbone N, CA, C, O of residues no entry resolves, built by a constrained chain model: each neck linker (native human KIF5B sequence) joins its head's last deposited residue to residue 339 of a 3KIN coil helix with 3.8 A CA-CA bonds, CA(i)-CA(i+2) 5.5-7.0 A and at least 4.5 A clearance; each stalk helix (poly-Ala, numbered from 1000 x panel + 1) continues the 3KIN coil as an idealised two-stranded coiled coil. Illustrative, not experimental."
  }
